    "detailed_description": "<br><br>Hey my fellow puzzle games lover and welcome to Hamsters' new ... puzzle game!<br>So, what's here for you?<br><br><strong>It's All About expanding Numbers</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964420/extras/48c161c0f81d9d50280856e84aa1f349.poster.avif?t=1729158921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964420/extras/48c161c0f81d9d50280856e84aa1f349.webm?t=1729158921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964420/extras/48c161c0f81d9d50280856e84aa1f349.mp4?t=1729158921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Using Clues</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964420/extras/1dc841114866f6d379062cd53568357e.poster.avif?t=1729158921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964420/extras/1dc841114866f6d379062cd53568357e.webm?t=1729158921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964420/extras/1dc841114866f6d379062cd53568357e.mp4?t=1729158921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>And Solving Big and Challenging Puzzles!</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964420/extras/105a57b8a55a5878fe20aadce0683d54.poster.avif?t=1729158921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964420/extras/105a57b8a55a5878fe20aadce0683d54.webm?t=1729158921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964420/extras/105a57b8a55a5878fe20aadce0683d54.mp4?t=1729158921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Simple yet challenging.<br></li><li>Especially on hard difficulty.<br></li><li>Many play modes.<br></li><li>Fully randomized grids.</li></ul><br>Enjoy, share, review! Thanks a million &lt;3<br><br>I Love You All, Thanks For Playing!<br>Yours,<br>Mike Aka Hamster On Coke",
