20/extras/105a57b8a55a5878fe20aadce0683d54.mp4?t=1729158921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Simple yet challenging.<br></li><li>Especially on hard difficulty.<br></li><li>Many play modes.<br></li><li>Fully randomized grids.</li></ul><br>Enjoy, share, review! Thanks a million &lt;3<br><br>I Love You All, Thanks For Playing!<br>Yours,<br>Mike Aka Hamster On Coke",
